<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "If any difficulty or anomaly arises in connection with the implementation of this Act, the Minister may by order make such modifications to any provision of this Act as may appear to him to be necessary for removing or preventing such difficulty or anomaly: Provided that the Minister shall not exercise the powers conferred by this section after the expiration of three years from the appointed date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In this section, \"modifications\" amendments, additions, deletions, substitutions, adaptations, variations, alteration and non-application of any provision of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka (Dissolution) Act 1997 and shall come into force on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/name> "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"appointed date\" means the date appointed by the Minister under section 1; \"Federal Lands Commissioner\" means the Federal Lands Commissioner appointed under the Federal Lands Commissioner Act 1957; \"Lembaga\" means the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka established under the Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka Act 1983; \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with the responsibility for rural development."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Lembaga Kemajuan Wilayah Jengka Act 1983 is repealed and the Lembaga established thereunder is dissolved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "All powers, rights, privileges, duties, liabilities and obligations which immediately before the appointed date were those of the Lembaga shall, as from that date, devolve on the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "All lands which immediately before the appointed date were vested in the Lembaga shall, on the appointed date, vest in the Federal Lands Commissioner for the purposes of the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All properties and assets other than land which immediately before the appointed date were vested in the Lembaga or in any person on its behalf shall, on that date, vest in the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "All moneys standing in, or due to be paid to, the Lembaga shall, on the appointed date, be transferred to, and vest in the Government."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "All deeds, bonds, agreements, instruments and working arrangements subsisting immediately before the appointed date and affecting any of the property transferred under section 5 shall be full force and effect against or in favour of the Government and enforceable as fully and effectually as if, instead of the Lembaga or any person acting on its behalf, the Government had been named therein or had been a party thereto."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
