<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/6/eng@> .
